  {
   "id": "zephras-isle:124",
   "tags": {},
   "text": [
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Orchard field (46-48.6, 77-80): pick up 10 Ripe Stormapples from the ground under the trees and kill 5 Hungry Bandits among them. Grab 5 Flutterfly Dust from the ground on the north side of the field (47-48.6, 77-79.5)."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "The Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct stands in the field (48.6, 78.4): accept What Is My Purpose? (it's done on accept) and hand it to Aamelia at the field edge (47.5, 78.4)."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "All of this took about 6 minutes in the playtest, with plenty of apples and dust around."
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
