      {
       "t": "Galestrider field east of the orchard (49-53, 78-82.5): kill Ornery Galestriders for 7 Lowlands Galestrider Tenderloins."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Low drop rate: 7 Tenderloins took 19 Galestriders (37%) and about 11 minutes. They're densest at 49.5-52, 79-80. They give about 67 XP each at level 10, so the time is not lost."
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
